1
00:00:01,459 --> 00:00:03,545
My name is Deepak Joshi.

2
00:00:04,087 --> 00:00:09,217
And I am a resident of Kyava village of Chakrata.

3
00:00:09,259 --> 00:00:11,678
My village is very famous.

4
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:15,306
We also had a revolutionary in Jaunsar Bawar –

5
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:16,516
Martyr Kesari Chand.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,810
Our village, Medha, is named after him...

7
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:19,728
Chakrata.

8
00:00:19,728 --> 00:00:22,939
One is Chakrata's Ramtal Garden.

9
00:00:24,065 --> 00:00:26,609
So our Kyaava village is like this.

10
00:00:26,609 --> 00:00:29,612
It is considered a very ideal village.

11
00:00:29,612 --> 00:00:30,780
Yes...
